bout drinking great coffee. But as choice and information have exploded, bu=
ying a bag has turned into decision overload. Most people want the same thi=
ng: to enjoy excellent coffee without harming the planet or the people who =
grow it, but making that choice confidently still requires deep industry kn=
owledge.=E2=80=9D<br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-weight: bold;">One truly =
innovative thing they=E2=80=99re doing: </span>=E2=80=9CUnlike wine, which =
